- a launch without McCabe's co-signature;
- an item on which Watson's binding Civil veto still stands against the final orders: compressed maturity, a disclosed date earlier than launch plus development years (for UltraFan WB, 2056), or no support plan before EIS;
- a red-line flag left unresolved;
- any non-empty `overrides`.
